<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sets variable rate repo.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sets variable rate repo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal set a variable rate repo and left its fixed money market rates unchanged on Friday for the start of a new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>Bids for the 10 billion escudo repo must be presented by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>The drain rate, the rate at which the Bank absorbs funds, was left unchanged at 5.8 percent. The emergency lending rate was also unchanged at 7.8 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
